+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,24 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Registers a browser push subscription for the signed-in user. Posting the same
+endpoint again updates its keys rather than adding a second subscription.
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://push.example.com/device-specific-endpoint",
+    "p256dh_key": "base64url-encoded-p256dh",
+    "auth_key": "base64url-encoded-auth"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the subscription `id`.
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions/:id`
+
+Stops pushes for that subscription only. Returns `204 No Content` on success.
